      "name": "Basant Choudhary",
      "created_at": "2025-11-05T19:38:04.879Z",
      "cooked": "<p>All financial numbers, like those in P&amp;L and B/S should use financial precision (set to 2). But it is instead showing 3 places decimal (as float precision is set to 3).</p>\n<p>Could someone also explain Banker’s rounding vs commercial rounding and which one is recommended for Indian businesses?</p>",
