      "created_at": "2025-11-06T13:42:57.729Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/basant\">@Basant</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Rounding Method</strong>: Specifies rounding method to be used everywhere. The default rounding method is Banker’s Rounding which rounds 0.5 to nearest even number. “Commercial Rounding” which rounds 0.5 to next number away from zero, e.g. 1.5 becomes 2.0 and -1.5 becomes -2.0 when rounded.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Please help yourself with documentation as following;</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/system-settings\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://docs.frappe.io/assets/frappe/images/frappe-favicon.svg\" class=\"site-icon\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/system-settings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">docs.frappe.io</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    \n\n<h3><a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/system-settings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">System Settings</a></h3>\n\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
